1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Sometimes it feels as if money can give us everything...

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
...but it is love that makes life whole.

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,500
Appa, look at me!

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,500
Just for one day — no work — shall we go out together as a family?

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,500
There's so much work right now, Nandini...

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Alright... no work today. Let's go!

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Whoa... it's an old palace!

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Mommy... something is shining over there!

9
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Hehe! The monkey is dancing!

10
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,500
I am the Genie who has lived in this lamp for a thousand years!

11
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,000
You look just like the Genie from the cartoons!

12
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:55,000
I grant you three wishes. Choose them wisely!

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
I wish for a lot of money!

14
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:33,500
With all of this... why does it feel so empty?

15
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:39,500
Money alone cannot bring happiness.

16
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,500
I wish to become famous all over the world!

17
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Everyone is here... but no one is with me.

18
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Fame alone cannot make a life complete.

19
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Hamruthaa, what do you wish for, my dear?

20
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:42,000
I wish our family is always happy... and that we help everyone.

21
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:01,000
One small loving wish... changed the whole world.

22
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:15,500
Here — a gift for your family!

23
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:43,000
The real magic is love.

24
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Money, fame, and riches will all fade one day...

25
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,000
...but love, family, and a heart that helps others live forever.
